# Shared Services Directory
#
# Place cross-cutting services here that are shared across multiple modules.
# Examples:
# - email_service.py        -> Transactional emails, SMTP, SendGrid
# - storage_service.py      -> AWS S3, Cloudinary, file uploads
# - payment_service.py      -> Stripe, Razorpay payment processing
# - notification_service.py -> SMS, Push notifications, Webhooks
#
# Note:
# Logic specific to a single domain should stay within its module:
# e.g., app/modules/todo/todo_service.py
